  "worked_solution": "Let's recall the graph of $y={log}_{8}⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14245974/assets/8e38a8edb560a0ddaa2e7802048ea0285e7bf3e72325de0a48f2672d9e81112c.png)\n\nThe domain of $y={log}_{8}⁡x$ is $x\\in (0,\\infty )$ and the range is $y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $x>0.$",
